  "title": "Backtest bt-2026-07",
  "text": "Backtest report, run bt-2026-07.\nThe backtest covered 49 rebalance periods between July 2022 and August 2025. Net excess return averaged 29 basis points per period, with a 95% confidence interval from -43 to 95 basis points. The strategy did not beat the benchmark with statistical confidence.\n",
